To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool, access it at vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org and follow the setup instructions for your preferred client, such as Claude Desktop or GitHub Copilot. Configure the MCP server settings, restart your client if necessary, and test the connection by asking questions like "Get information about the neuron " or "Search for terms related to medulla in the fly brain".

```
{
"mcpServers": {
"virtual-fly-brain": {
"type": "http",
"url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
"tools": ["*"]
}
}
}
```
